[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉！　すごいぞ！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』に出場できる！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "013",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……本当？　本当に私、『W.I.N.G.』に出られるの？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだ！　夏葉の日々の積み重ねと、\r\n努力があったからこそ、今ここに繋がったんだ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサーにそう言ってもらえて、すごくうれしい\r\nなんだかホッとしたわ……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、自信がなかったのか？　自分のやり方については\r\nとっくに覚悟を決めたんだろ？",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、確かにあの迷いは乗り越えたわ\r\nでも……不安に思ってしまうことも……あるのよ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だから、今でもやっぱり……努力をしても\r\n頑張ったことが上手くいかなかったら、とか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "たまによ？\r\nたまにだけど……そう考えて不安になったりもするの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうときは、俺をもっと頼ってくれてもいいんだぞ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "弱音を吐く暇なんて私にはないのよ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……まあでも、今度何かあったらそうするわ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、必ず力になるよ。『W.I.N.G.』を\r\n全力で挑めるように不安は解消していこう",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そうね\r\n後悔するなんて、絶対に嫌だもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……でも、良かった",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "これで私のしてきたことは間違いじゃないって、\r\nまた自信が持てた気がする",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだ本番はこれからだぞ、気を引き締めていこう",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……私が弱みを見せるなんて\r\nあまりしないんだから",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "優しくしといて損はないと思うけど？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは、すっかりいつもの夏葉じゃないか\r\nこのまま優勝を狙って行くぞ！",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001070140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、私とプロデューサーならきっと大丈夫ね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300107/7013001070140"
